{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1000_p", "source_sha256": "734f7f7dde7b96eaee197028bcd4cddca078920979a05a66196c7d4e10a07afe", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n翼は『ナイトルーティン』というテーマに挑む……）", "zh": "（今天要为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄。\n翼要挑战“夜间例行习惯”这一主题……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "817437567e2d03ce549021bf45a595e0efd45f7ff226b7fb9a81f3c71312c08e", "ja": "うわ～、かわいいネイルグッズがいっぱいですね！\nオイルにネイルファイル……あっ、これ好きかも♪", "zh": "哇～，好多可爱的美甲工具呀！\n有指缘油，还有指甲锉……啊，我可能挺喜欢这个的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1002_p", "source_sha256": "245301d8ebce28381eb1b58b8f399a0f97f3cb356e5994af4a5453983225431d", "ja": "翼が撮影の時にあるといいって言ってたから。\nスタッフさんに頼んで用意してもらったんだ。", "zh": "因为翼说拍摄时有这些就好了。我就拜托工作人员准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "05a3db9788fd12cfacc28f996fc2f3525af2d651700857f720b48b19b689afbd", "ja": "ありがとうございま～す♪\nあ、このキラキラのカラーポリッシュいいかも～。", "zh": "谢谢你～♪\n啊，这个闪闪发光的彩色指甲油好像不错耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7277a576c998720a46999db9d6224d7b30bff0fcaea48892c6bc3eb802814e39", "ja": "……ちょっと質問なんだが、ナイトルーティンって\nいうのは、爪のケアとかするものじゃないのか？", "zh": "……我有点疑问，所谓的睡前日常，\n难道不是保养指甲之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f92d9610aa5cf88f31a3459c49364711c1daee45f7358fda8c449c79be04250f", "ja": "プライベートならそうかもですけど……今は撮影だし、\nキレイめなネイルにした方がいいかなって。", "zh": "如果是私下的话，可能会做这些吧……不过现在是在拍摄，我觉得还是做个漂亮又优雅的美甲比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1afc5ad96f3c3f5e5dac045bf2b924c9abb8cae84b0693e91cedd21172e20a8a", "ja": "こーんなステキなパジャマで、ネイルまでしてたら\nわたしも、オトナっぽく見えると思いませんか？", "zh": "穿着这么漂亮的睡衣，还做了美甲，\n您不觉得我看起来也更成熟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1007_p", "source_sha256": "28f5042c858babbf887cad1c4aad479f34aceb2dddef02b76c6fabb111b23596", "ja": "まあ、それは確かに……？", "zh": "嗯，那倒确实……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "011f8c41d0dd24640194f079243c1fdc623200f9a2ed372b34f67c962a7a8711", "ja": "でしょ♪　でも、種類がありすぎて迷っちゃうなぁ。\nこの明るいのなんか、ナチュラルで受けがよさそう。", "zh": "对吧♪不过种类实在太多了，都让人挑花眼了。\n像这种明亮的，感觉很自然，应该会很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2b2d9fb380830ec3e8f39b4ef9aaa1e81ad7fc31b459efe9ad2248763cc9301", "ja": "あ、でもでもこっちのシックなラメ入りも、\nオトナっぽい感じがしていいですよね。", "zh": "啊，不过这个带着低调亮粉的颜色，也很有成熟的感觉，很不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a30fe97721e358a8cd2f69f964e40ae32a1ccef82eeea1dc211a1b24a9a3adc", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどっちの色がいいと思います？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，\n哪个颜色比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a07df4f413db2aaf28ee66c4a831918fd33fb1a2e1780da2f3e674f916d87ade", "ja": "えっ？　いや、翼にも撮影のプランがあるだろうし、\n好きな方を選んだら……。", "zh": "诶？不，翼应该也有拍摄方案吧，选你喜欢的就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "40c8a1ee5a87c39057213998177ba7a3cc7614f24a59795a3063cced03e4f988", "ja": "どっちもステキだから選べないんですよ～。わたし、\n{$P$}さんの意見も聞きたいな～？", "zh": "两个都很棒，所以选不出来嘛～我也想听听{$P$}先生的意见～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1013_p", "source_sha256": "70f68fcb8ff6f60cb0502987acb5ae6f6d37469ea464f542c0fda7171247bdff", "ja": "うっ、わかった……。そうだな……ラメ入り、かな。\n爪の先まで撮影映えしそうだし、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "唔，我知道了……我想想……选带亮片的吧。\n连指尖在拍照时都会很上镜，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d7ee5cd4f2c2f00571cf33e5ff2e7ce5495c22e74c4a2c40c0889dedf53e219", "ja": "そっかー……{$P$}さんは\nこういうのが好きなんだー。", "zh": "这样啊——……原来{$P$}先生喜欢这种东西啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1015_p", "source_sha256": "410026780799451d86f32b8fd25ff5df007b80a5cd7ef23b7928681327e490d1", "ja": "ええっ！？　違っ……。", "zh": "诶！？不是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0523_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "da5c6011d35a2d2ea2858e994aaaad5a70753f694bb4baf8b7bfd7f90941c093", "ja": "えへへっ、いいこと聞いちゃった♪\n明日から劇場に付けて行っちゃおーっと。", "zh": "嘿嘿，听到好事了♪  \n从明天开始就戴去剧场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
